  "prefLabel": "Vet 604.02 Maintaining a VCPR",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Vet 604.02 Maintaining a VCPR. A VCPR shall expire unless an in-person physical examination or an in-person site visit has been completed by the licensed veterinarian in the prior 365 days.\n\nSource. #13453, eff 9-29-22",
